Keeps this directory in the repository while it is empty.

Git does not track empty directories, so without this the folder exists on
the machine where the collection was added and nowhere else — which is
exactly how it failed: `npm run verify` passed locally and check-cms.mjs
refused the build in CI, correctly, with "folder src/content/library does
not exist". The glob loader reads **/*.mdx, so this file is not an entry.
